      "width": 24,
      "height": 4,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "# RaiBert operations\nProduction resources only. Gaps mean no published samples, not proof of health. Error and throttle metrics may be sparse. Storage and certificate metrics update less frequently.\n\n[Analytics](https://console.aws.amazon.com/cloudwatch/home?region=us-east-1#dashboards:name=raibert-prod-usage) | [Operations](https://console.aws.amazon.com/cloudwatch/home?region=us-east-1#dashboards:name=raibert-prod-operations) | [Cost](https://console.aws.amazon.com/cloudwatch/home?region=us-east-1#dashboards:name=raibert-prod-cost)"
      }
    },
